  "question": {
    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;in the interval&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now plotting the graph we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fb839449-bb1d-4fcf-8b19-c9bcdc42fb84-image.png\" style=\"width: 415px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>Now by graph number of solutions in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
